,"brief":"把帧序列合成视频文件，三条支线各导出一份便于横向对比","desc":""},{"id":"70","title":"LoadImage","type":"LoadImage","cat":"load","x":-1424,"y":-1098,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE"},{"name":"MASK","type":"MASK"}],"widgets":["image_fx_ (42).jpg","image"],"brief":"节点 45/46 是旁路的额外参考图，启用后进入多参考编辑","desc":""},{"id":"62","title":"String Constant Multiline (Text Prompt)","type":"StringConstantMultiline","cat":"util","x":-1453,"y":-592,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"STRING","type":"STRING"}],"widgets":["* A1(AI는 에이원) https://www.youtube.com/@A01dem…","true"],"brief":"提示词、触发词、负向词的文本源","desc":""}],"links":[{"from":"17","fromOut":0,"to":"39","toIn":4},{"from":"39","fromOut":0,"to":"33","toIn":0},{"from":"20","fromOut":0,"to":"39","toIn":3},{"from":"48","fromOut":0,"to":"17","toIn":1},{"from":"48","fromOut":0,"to":"20","toIn":0},{"from":"50","fromOut":0,"to":"48","toIn":0},{"from":"51","fromOut":1,"to":"50","toIn":2},{"from":"51","fromOut":0,"to":"50","toIn":1},{"from":"50","fromOut":0,"to":"58","toIn":0},{"from":"69","fromOut":0,"to":"39","toIn":8},{"from":"27","fromOut":0,"to":"71","toIn":0},{"from":"70","fromOut":0,"to":"72","toIn":0},{"from":"13","fromOut":0,"to":"73","toIn":0},{"from":"73","fromOut":0,"to":"74","toIn":0},{"from":"72","fromOut":0,"to":"75","toIn":0},{"from":"75","fromOut":0,"to":"51","toIn":0},{"from":"74","fromOut":0,"to":"47","toIn":0},{"from":"71","fromOut":0,"to":"76","toIn":0},{"from":"62","fromOut":0,"to":"77","toIn":0},{"from":"77","fromOut":0,"to":"78","toIn":0},{"from":"79","fromOut":0,"to":"39","toIn":0},{"from":"78","fromOut":0,"to":"47","toIn":1},{"from":"12","fromOut":0,"to":"81","toIn":0},{"from":"81","fromOut":0,"to":"82","toIn":0},{"from":"82","fromOut":0,"to":"83","toIn":0},{"from":"83","fromOut":0,"to":"20","toIn":1},{"from":"84","fromOut":0,"to":"33","toIn":1},{"from":"18","fromOut":0,"to":"85","toIn":0},{"from":"85","fromOut":0,"to":"86","toIn":0},{"from":"86","fromOut":0,"to":"87","toIn":0},{"from":"87","fromOut":0,"to":"17","toIn":0},{"from":"76","fromOut":0,"to":"88","toIn":0},{"from":"88","fromOut":0,"to":"79","toIn":0},{"from":"47","fromOut":0,"to":"89","toIn":0},{"from":"75","fromOut":0,"to":"90","toIn":0},{"from":"90","fromOut":0,"to":"50","toIn":0},{"from":"89","fromOut":0,"to":"91","toIn":0},{"from":"91","fromOut":0,"to":"39","toIn":1},{"from":"47","fromOut":0,"to":"92","toIn":0},{"from":"92","fromOut":0,"to":"15","toIn":0},{"from":"15","fromOut":0,"to":"39","toIn":2},{"from":"83","fromOut":0,"to":"93","toIn":0},{"from":"93","fromOut":0,"to":"84","toIn":0},{"from":"33","fromOut":0,"to":"44","toIn":0},{"from":"44","fromOut":0,"to":"23","toIn":0}],"ai":{"s":"FramePack 单图生视频工作流。LoadImage 的首帧图先由 FramePackFindNearestBucket 匹配到最接近的合法分辨率桶，再按桶宽高 ImageResize+ 缩放——FramePack 对画幅有硬性约束，任意尺寸直接喂会出错。缩放后的同一张图分两路：一路过 sigclip 视觉编码器产出 image embeds，向模型传达画面内容与运动线索；另一路 VAEEncode 成首帧潜空间，作为采样起点。提示词走 Hunyuan 双文本编码器（clip_l+llava_llama3），负向条件用 ConditioningZeroOut 清零，是 Hunyuan 系的固定接法。FramePackSampler 按 Float Constant 给出的 5 秒总时长逐段去噪，内置遥测缓存加速；最后 VAEDecodeTiled 分块解码省显存，VHS_VideoCombine 合成视频文件。","u":["一张人物或风景静图，配一句运动描述，直接产出 5 秒短视频","把插画或 AI 出图转成动态壁纸，走 FramePack 逐段生成不怕显存不足","批量验证提示词对镜头运动的影响：换 LoadImage 图片和 String Constant 文本即可复跑","低成本试做 i2v 动画分镜，总时长一个 Float Constant 就能调"],"d":2,"st":[{"name":"输入与分辨率分桶","desc":"载入首帧图后先找最接近的合法分辨率桶再缩放，FramePack 只接受特定画幅，这一步决定整条视频的分辨率上限。","nodes":["70","51","50","58","48"]},{"name":"模型装载","desc":"fp8 量化的 FramePack I2V 主模型可选 torch.compile 加速，CLIP/VAE/视觉编码器三件套各自独立加载，缺一采样跑不起来。","nodes":["71","27","13","12","18"]},{"name":"文本条件","desc":"运动与画面描述经 Hunyuan 双编码器编码为正向条件；负向清零是这套模型的惯用做法，负向提示词写了也不起作用。","nodes":["62","47","15"]},{"name":"图像条件编码","desc":"同一张缩放图分别变成视觉嵌入（告诉模型画里有什么）和首帧潜空间（采样的起点），FramePack 生成的就是从这帧往后延伸的内容。","nodes":["17","20","69"]},{"name":"采样","desc":"FramePackSampler 把图像嵌入、首帧潜空间、正负条件与总时长组装起来逐段去噪，是全图唯一的核心计算节点。","nodes":["39"]},{"name":"解码与输出","desc":"潜空间分块解码成帧序列，再由 VHS_VideoCombine 打包成视频文件，GetImageSizeAndCount 顺带输出帧数信息便于核对。","nodes":["33","44","23"]}],"p":"总时长由 Total Seconds Float Constant（默认 5）控制，拉长视频生成时间近似线性增加；采样保持图里默认的 30 步、unipc_bh1、CFG 0.15 即可，这套模型不需要高 CFG；分辨率别手改 ImageResize+，它吃的是分桶节点算出的宽高。","n":"需要 FramePack 节点包与 pysssss/essentials/KJNodes/rgthree/VHS 一组插件，5 个模型文件（FramePackI2V fp8 主模型、clip_l、llava_llama3、hunyuan_video VAE、sigclip 视觉编码器）都要提前放到对应目录；fp8 加分块解码对 12GB 级显存比较友好。"}}